// 003.3: a component named twice is one value in both positions (`Holder actor Claimant actor`).
// Giving it two different arguments would bind one and drop the other, so the application is
// refused (CHR036); the same argument twice is accepted.
//! expect-error: CHR036
Fact person Identified by Iris, Wren
Fact self Identified by person * person.
+self(Iris, Iris).
?self(Iris, Iris).
+self(Iris, Wren).
